My personal experience with Redhat on my Ultra 5 has been similar.  Not
very often, but sometimes, the box would crash with no clear indications
of a problem.  I never spent much time investigating the crashes because
the system was not critical.  I have found, however, that kernel
2.3.99-pre3 made the crashes stop for me.  As of yesterday, I'm playing
with 2.3.99-pre6.  I'm afraid that's all I can offer for now...

